  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the secretariat of the partners coordination group in the Democratic Republic of the Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partners coordination group (GCP) is a high level forum that facilitates dialogue and shared initiatives among bilateral and multilateral donors in order to support the development efforts of the government of the Democratic Republic of the Congo (DRC).

The GCP aims to support coordination of the donor community in order to improve transparency, coherence, and collective engagement on key policies of the DRC government in order to promote development and reduce poverty in the DRC.

This activity contributes to the running and activity costs of the GCP secretariat.</narrative>
  </description>
